{"id":"n84661-2-9","stage":1,"title":"필통 · 笔盒","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84661-2-9-1","ko":"지수야, 지우개 있어?","zh":"智秀，你有橡皮吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"지우개","meaning":"橡皮擦","explanation":"지우개：橡皮擦","readings":[{"term":"지우개","audio":"/audio/d8ce7221b93e9feaaae9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71488","senseId":"1","lemma":"지우개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d8ce7221b93e9fea","term":"지우개","zh":"橡皮擦","audio":"/audio/d8ce7221b93e9feaaae9.mp3","entryId":"71488","definition":"一种擦拭铅笔字迹的橡胶物品。","pronunciation":["지우개"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1dddc7a200f4104ff1e4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84661-2-9-2","ko":"잠깐만. 필통에 있을 텐데.","zh":"稍等一下，应该在笔袋里吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만.","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필통에","meaning":"笔盒，笔匣","explanation":"필통：笔盒，笔匣；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"필통","audio":"/audio/e47e18551c74b1dc3381.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84661","senseId":"2","lemma":"필통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"텐데.","meaning":"表示打算、推测或意志。","explanation":"터：表示打算、推测或意志。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72183","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"e47e18551c74b1dc","term":"필통","zh":"笔盒，笔匣","audio":"/audio/e47e18551c74b1dc3381.mp3","entryId":"84661","definition":"放入铅笔、橡皮等而携带的袋子或盒子。","pronunciation":["필통"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"表示打算、推测或意志。","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"72183","definition":"表示打算、推测或意志。","pronunciation":["터"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4c8834d80c151219d76.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.16,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84661","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":41,"sequenceScore":1.8853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["稍等一下，应该在笔袋里吧。","智秀，你有橡皮吗？","我觉得历史课是最有趣的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，你有橡皮吗？","我觉得历史课是最有趣的。","稍等一下，应该在笔袋里吧。"],"answer":2}]}
